# Old Flitterfang: "At the beginning of each end step, if a creature died this turn, create a Food token." Bot2's bolt
# kills Bot2's own Mons's Goblin Raiders on Bot2's turn; at that turn's end step Bot1 (Flitterfang's controller) gets
# one Food, whoever's creature died and whoever's turn it is (CR 603.4: the "if" holds as the step begins).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Old Flitterfang
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mons's Goblin Raiders
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Old Flitterfang.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mons's Goblin Raiders.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mons's Goblin Raiders)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Swamp; Old Flitterfang
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Mons's Goblin Raiders; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Swamp; Old Flitterfang; Food Token
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mountain
